    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help our banshee make her way through the treacherous Fairy Land by collecting all kinds of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 18 levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple banshees with different charms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards from 6 races. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 cards! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main hero has an exclusive clothing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destruction system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy and powerful banshees are waiting for you to defeat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse fairy summoning: Summon dozens of fairies with different abilities to create your own powerful combinations.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help our banshee make her way through the treacherous Fairy Land by collecting all kinds of cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 18 levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple banshees with different charms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards from 6 races. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 cards! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main hero has an exclusive clothing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destruction system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy and powerful banshees are waiting for you to defeat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse fairy summoning: Summon dozens of fairies with different abilities to create your own powerful combinations.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Manipulate the cycle of life and death in the frozen realm \u2014 every decision you make will either accelerate the demise of your enemies... or bring an early end to yourself.",
